sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Cl as Cache client
    participant Sh as Cache shard
    participant DB as Origin database
    App->>Cl: get(key)
    Cl->>Cl: consistent-hash to a shard
    Cl->>Sh: get
    alt hit
        Sh-->>App: value
    else miss
        Sh-->>Cl: miss
        Cl->>Cl: take per-key lock
        Note over Cl: one loader per key, the rest wait — stops a stampede
        Cl->>DB: read
        DB-->>Cl: row
        Cl->>Sh: set with TTL and jitter
        Cl-->>App: value
    end
